## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the `pcapng file` from challenge using `wget`.
2. Open wireshark, click file at `top left and click open` and choose the `pcapng file`.
3. Open the network capture in Wireshark.
4. Click `File -> Export Objects -> TFTP...` and click `Save All to download all the hidden files` (instructions.txt, plan, program.deb, and the pictures).
5. Open and decode the text files in your terminal using the cat and tr commands to reveal the hidden clues:
	• Run `cat instructions.txt | tr 'A-Za-z' 'N-ZA-Mn-za-m'` to read the instructions.
	• Run `cat plan.txt | tr 'A-Za-z' 'N-ZA-Mn-za-m'` to reveal the secret passphrase: `DUEDILIGENCE`.
6. Install the extraction tool contained in the folder by typing:
`sudo apt install steghide`
Use code with caution.
7. Extract the hidden flag from the third image by running this exact command with the passphrase you decoded:
`steghide extract -sf picture3.bmp -p DUEDILIGENCE`
Use code with caution.
6. Open the newly created text file to see your flag:
`cat flag.txt`

